### 📋 NOTES:

### EMAIL REQUIREMENTS:
### 1. .env harus dikonfigurasi dengan:
###    - EMAIL_SERVICE=gmail
###    - EMAIL_USER=your_email@gmail.com
###    - EMAIL_PASSWORD=your_app_password
###    - EMAIL_FROM=Markas Lapangan <noreply@markaslapangan.com>
###
### 2. Untuk Gmail:
###    - Enable 2-Step Verification
###    - Generate App Password (16 karakter)
###    - Masukkan ke EMAIL_PASSWORD di .env
###
### 3. User harus memiliki email valid di database

### STATUS PEMBAYARAN FLOW:
### pending → waiting_confirmation → paid (confirmed)
###                              ↘ rejected (rejected)

### AVAILABLE STATUS:
### ✅ pending
### ✅ waiting_confirmation
### ✅ paid (setelah dikonfirmasi admin)
### ✅ rejected (setelah ditolak admin)

---

### 🔧 TIPS TESTING:

### Jika using Postman:
### 1. Create environment dengan variables:
###    - baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
###    - adminToken = [copy dari login admin]
###    - userToken = [copy dari login user]
###    - bookingId = [copy dari create booking response]
###
### 2. Jalankan requests secara berurutan (1 → 2 → 3)
###
### 3. Cek email user (Gmail/Mailtrap) setelah step 3

### Testing dengan cURL:
### curl -X PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/booking/{id}/confirm-payment \
###   -H "Authorization: Bearer {token}" \
###   -H "Content-Type: application/json"

